sequenceDiagram
autonumber
participant Main as __main__
participant DMS as DeliveryManagementSystem
participant UD as UserDirectory
participant SR as StaffRoster
participant DR as DeliveryRegistry
Main->>DMS: start(dataDir, clock)
DMS->>DMS: create JsonStore, ServiceArea, Standard/ExpressPricing, PaymentGateway
DMS->>UD: create + load()
UD-->>DMS: concrete Client / OfficeStaff / BusinessOwner / DeliveryStaff restored
DMS->>DMS: create NotificationService(outbox, UD.emailOf)
DMS->>SR: create(store, UD) + load()
SR->>UD: deliveryStaff()
Note over SR: refuses to start if availability names an unknown driver
DMS->>DR: create(store, UD, SR, area, pricing, notifier, clock) + load()
DR->>UD: find(client / driver ids) - integrity check
DMS->>SR: setCommitmentSource(DR.commitmentsFor)
DMS->>DR: attachObservers()
Note over DR: observers attached after history is rebuilt, so nothing is re-sent
DMS->>DR: expireLapsedQuotes()
DMS->>DMS: save()
Main->>Main: seed_demo() if --seed-demo, then ConsoleApp(dms).run()
